# tools/ holds the CV->PDF pipeline SOURCE (tools/cv/{cv.html,cv.css,build_cv.py}), which IS tracked.
# Everything else under tools/ is local dev scratch (version screenshots, verify logs, snapshot
# scripts) and must never be committed. The *.png / *.txt globs catch all of it, so per-version
# dirs (v12, v13, ... v23-dark) need no individual rules.
tools/**/*.png
tools/**/*.txt
tools/snapshot*.py
tools/cv/cv-preview.png

# Private, never-published material lives OUTSIDE this repo in a sibling dir
# (../_homepage-rebuild-private/). Guard against it ever being copied back in.
_homepage-rebuild-private/
docs/homepage-rebuild/